          %h2#joining_our_research Joining our research
          %p If you are a graduate student or young postdoc thinking of entering the Sati-Schreiber program, here is some basic reading to start with:
          %ul
            %li
              %p
                for relevant basics of general
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/homotopy+theory"} homotopy theory
                and
                = succeed "/" do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/infinity-stacks"}
                    %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}>
                      %semantics
                        %mrow
                          %mn ∞
                        %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} \infty
                    \-stacks
                = succeed ":" do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/smooth+infinity-groupoids"}
                    smooth
                    = succeed "-groupoids" do
                      %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                        %semantics
                          %mrow
                            %mn ∞
                          %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} \infty
              %p
                see the chapter
                %em Model categories
                in
                %em
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/schreiber/show/The+Character+Map+in+Non-Abelian+Cohomology"} The Character Map in Non-Abelian Cohomology
                (chapter 1 in the printed version, appendix in the arXiv version)
              %p
                and for more details the nLab entries
                %em
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Introduction+to+Homotopy+Theory"} Introduction to Homotopy Theory
                or for yet more details
                = succeed "," do
                  %em
                    %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/geometry+of+physics+--+categories+and+toposes"} geometry of physics – categories and toposes
              %p
                quick exposition is in
                = succeed "," do
                  %em
                    %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/schreiber/show/Higher+Topos+Theory+in+Physics"} Higher Topos Theory in Physics
            %li
              %p
                for relevant basics of
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/rational+homotopy+theory"} rational homotopy theory
                and
                = succeed ":" do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/L-infinity+algebras"}
                    %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}>
                      %semantics
                        %mrow
                          %msub
                            %mi L
                            %mn ∞
                        %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} L_\infty
                    \-Lie algebras
              %p
                see the part
                %em Non-abelian de Rham cohomology
                in
                = succeed "," do
                  %em
                    %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/schreiber/show/The+Character+Map+in+Non-Abelian+Cohomology"} The Character Map in Non-Abelian Cohomology
            %li
