                          %mrow
                            %mi p
                          %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} p
              %p
                see the articles
                %em
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/schreiber/show/Flux+Quantization+on+11d+Superspace"} Flux Quantization on 11d Superspace
                and
                %em
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/schreiber/show/Flux+Quantization+on+M5-Branes"} Flux Quantization on M5-Branes
              %p
                and/or the nLab entry
